        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtaligūlwa kwa matungījo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūmona ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo walītaligūla līmò lya matungījo mpungatī genayo. Ū mu shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine, niigwa shimò shayomba n'ilaka gītī lya kūpalalūka kwa mbula; gīkī, “Nzūgū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlola ī gīkī, nūbona falasa yape. Ū ndamhīji wayo walī na būta; winhwa ngikili, hūna ūja alīpyena nyapyeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo aho wataligūla itungījo lya kabīlī, niigwa Shiseeng'wa sha kabīlī ū mu Shiseeng'wa shipanga shenīsho; shūhaya, “Nzūgū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūfuma falasa yīngī, ī yene yaza, ūyo walī ayīdamhīlile winhwa līlūshū itaale, winhwa būdūla bo kūyīnja ī mhola ū mu sī; a banhū bandye kwibūlaga boi bike! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wataligūla itungījo lya kadatū, niigwa ī sha kadatū ū mu Shiseeng'wa shipanga; shūhaya, “Nzūgū!” Kūlola ī gīkī, nūbona falasa yapi, ūyo walī ayīdamhīlile walī n'ipimīlo ū mu nkono gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niigwa gītī ilaka lyafuma a ha gatī ya Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine shenīsho; līlīhaya gīkī, “Ngelekelo īmò ya ngano kū denali īmò, na ngelekelo idatū ja shayili kū denali īmò; a maguta a gene galekage gīko, pyī nū walwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wataligūla itungījo lya kane, nūliigwa ī lilaka lya Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī sha kane; shūhaya, “Nzūgū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nataalī nalolile nūbona falasa ya būshīni; ūyo walī ayīdamhīlile ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Lūfu, wakūūbījiagwa na Kūlimu! Binhwa būdūla bo kūja balībūlaga na līlūshū, na nzala, na mahūūya, na mashiinū ga mu mapoolu; bamale lobo ya banhū ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wataligūla itungījo lya katanò nūbona a ha sīlīlī ya ng'walīlo myoyo ya banhū abo baalī babūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu, na kūlwa nguno ya būkaanīji ūbo baalī babūdimile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīlaga n'ilaka lya higūlya balīhaya gīkī, “Ūkwikala ūlindīīlile kūshisha nanalī Seeba ng'wela na Ntūngīlīja? Ūtūbalamulaga a bikaji ba mu sī ūbamalīle shiilī kūlwa mininga gise?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna binhwa būlī ng'wene shizwalo shape, būwīlwa bifuule ho kakanza kado, kūshisha līng'we ī lisaabu lya batūmami bichabo, abo nabo balī hihī kūbūlagwa, gīt'ūmo bakīītīlwa a boi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wataligūla itungījo lya katandatū nūbona yabiza ho nyahīnga nhaale; ī līīmi lyūhīndīhala, lyūbiza gītī igūnīla lya booya būhīndīhazu, nū ng'weji gwalalūka pyī ū gose, gūbiza gītī mininga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sonda jūyūmodagūka ha sī, gīt'ūmo ntī gūkalagagījaga maholoosha gago ūlū gūtinginyiwa na nyaga ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ligūlū nalyo lyīnjiwa ho, lyūbiza gītī shitabo shilingilwe; na būlī lūgūlū, na a majinga a gose, shīnjiwa a ha wikalo washo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batemi ba mu sī na a batongeeji, hamò na a bataale ba mabita ga bashilikale, na a basabi, na a banhū ba makaya; pye na a basese na a babo balī mu wiyabī, bandya kwibisa mu ngūlū, mu mapilinga ga mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūjiwīla ī ngūlū na a mawe gīkī, “Tūpondejagi mutūbise twīnge ū kū būshū bokwe ūyo igashije hī Isumbi lya būtemi, nū būpelanu bo Ng'wana wa Ng'holo tūwibise! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū lūshikū lo kūpelanīlwa kwabo lwashikaga; nani ūyo akūgema kwīma ho?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
